{"id":"perfection","lemma":"perfection","pos":"noun","rank":4090,"glosses":["perfection"],"ipa":"/pɛʁ.fɛk.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dc/Fr-perfection.ogg/Fr-perfection.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","examples":[{"text":"La pratique conduit à la perfection.","en":"Practice makes perfect.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"practice"},{"g":"to drive","l":"conduire"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"Le poisson était cuit à la perfection.","en":"The fish was cooked to perfection.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"fish"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"cooked"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"Je n'attends de vous que la perfection.","en":"I expect nothing less than perfection.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Mon plan se déroule à la perfection.","en":"My plan is working perfectly.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"map"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to unroll","l":"dérouler"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"Nous nous efforçons d'atteindre la perfection.","en":"We strive for perfection.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to attain"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}